<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  OriginOS Toolkit — in-app brand mark.

  Identical geometry to the launcher foreground, shifted by (-18,-18) into a
  72-unit viewport so the ring fills 73% of its box. The launcher layer is
  generous on purpose — an adaptive icon needs the 66dp safe circle — but that
  same padding looks like a bug when the mark sits in a toolbar at 40dp. Hence
  a second, tightly-cropped copy rather than a scale factor at the call site.

  Draw it with `Icon(..., tint = Color.Unspecified)`; the sweep gradient is the
  whole point and a theme tint would flatten it.
-->
